    # VALA @ smile "Oh my! Isn't she gorgeous! I've never seen a wolf that colour before!"
    VALA @ smile "어머나! 정말 아름답구나! 저런 색깔의 늑대는 처음 보네요!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/SharedInThorns/scr_SharedInThorns_ClueVala.rpy:8
translate kr scr_SharedInThorns_valaClue_557bb7df:

    # ELENA "...Bark!"
    ELENA "...멍!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/SharedInThorns/scr_SharedInThorns_ClueVala.rpy:9
translate kr scr_SharedInThorns_valaClue_57250be8:

    # MC @ talk "Uhh, about that book I was looking for."
    MC @ talk "어, 그 책 말인데, 내가 찾고 있던."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/SharedInThorns/scr_SharedInThorns_ClueVala.rpy:10
translate kr scr_SharedInThorns_valaClue_8523e1d0:

    # VALA "Hm? Oh yes... Let me just check."
    VALA "음? 아 네... 잠시 확인해 볼게요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/SharedInThorns/scr_SharedInThorns_ClueVala.rpy:11
translate kr scr_SharedInThorns_valaClue_a0eb1ad5:

    # "Vala hurried over towards some book shelves, bring with her the ladder which she climbed up high on."
    "발라는 책장 쪽으로 서둘러 가서, 사다리를 가져와 높이 올라탔다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/SharedInThorns/scr_SharedInThorns_ClueVala.rpy:12
translate kr scr_SharedInThorns_valaClue_8347500c:

    # "With her fingers tracing along the many old books, she finally stopped on one and pulled it out of it's slot."
    "손가락으로 수많은 오래된 책들을 훑어내려가다, 마침내 한 권에 멈춰 그것을 꽂혀 있던 자리에서 뽑아냈다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/SharedInThorns/scr_SharedInThorns_ClueVala.rpy:13
translate kr scr_SharedInThorns_valaClue_2956b070:

    # VALA "Found it!"
    VALA "찾았다!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/SharedInThorns/scr_SharedInThorns_ClueVala.rpy:14
translate kr scr_SharedInThorns_valaClue_1898c265:

    # "Vala descended down the ladder and hurried back over towards me with the book in hand."
    "발라는 사다리에서 내려와 책을 손에 든 채 내게로 서둘러 돌아왔다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/SharedInThorns/scr_SharedInThorns_ClueVala.rpy:15
translate kr scr_SharedInThorns_valaClue_933d3a1a:

    # VALA "Here you go, there should be some mention of the Thornfalls in here."
    VALA "여기 있습니다, 이 안에 쏜폴 가문에 대한 언급이 있을 거예요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/SharedInThorns/scr_SharedInThorns_ClueVala.rpy:16
translate kr scr_SharedInThorns_valaClue_dd85037a:

    # MC @ talk "Thanks Vala."
    MC @ talk "고마워, 발라."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/SharedInThorns/scr_SharedInThorns_ClueVala.rpy:17
translate kr scr_SharedInThorns_valaClue_67e06f03:

    # VALA "Of course!"
    VALA "물론이죠!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/SharedInThorns/scr_SharedInThorns_ClueVala.rpy:18
translate kr scr_SharedInThorns_valaClue_59ba8c2f:

    # VALA "Might I so ask as to why you're reading up on old houses though?"
    VALA "그런데 왜 오래된 가문들에 대해 읽고 계신 건지 여쭤봐도 될까요?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/SharedInThorns/scr_SharedInThorns_ClueVala.rpy:19
translate kr scr_SharedInThorns_valaClue_ae1dbf62:

    # MC @ talk "Just uh, researching something."
    MC @ talk "그냥 어, 뭔가 조사 중이야."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/SharedInThorns/scr_SharedInThorns_ClueVala.rpy:20
translate kr scr_SharedInThorns_valaClue_6090a1b8:

    # VALA "Hm, well don't let me keep you from whatever you're looking for!"
    VALA "흠, 그럼 찾으시는 걸 방해하지 않을게요!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/SharedInThorns/scr_SharedInThorns_ClueVala.rpy:21
translate kr scr_SharedInThorns_valaClue_93d71026:

    # "Elena turned to look up to me."
    "엘레나는 고개를 돌려 나를 올려다봤다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/SharedInThorns/scr_SharedInThorns_ClueVala.rpy:22
translate kr scr_SharedInThorns_valaClue_86d6b42b:

    # MC @ talk "...Stop glaring, we need to keep up your disguise."
    MC @ talk "...그만 노려봐, 네 변장을 유지해야 하니까."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/SharedInThorns/scr_SharedInThorns_ClueVala.rpy:23
translate kr scr_SharedInThorns_valaClue_1392d72b:

